  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> ZOLLER Solutions for efficient production </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Benefit from our ZOLLER Tooling Solutions for your effective manufacturing process. We offer you a complete range of high-performance and high-precision tool holding systems for your machining tasks. ZOLLER Tooling Solutions also form the perfect interface for your digital production.</p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [
    {
     "kind": "iframe",
     "src": "https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/xmsnaIc1TvI?autohide=1&controls=1&enablejsapi=1&origin=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.zoller.info",
